{"t":"FE","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"FirstEnergy Corp.","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":11186,"hq":"Akron, OH, United States","website":"https://www.firstenergycorp.com","summary_en":"FirstEnergy Corp., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the generation, distribution, and transmission of electricity in the United States. It operates through Distribution, Integrated, and Stand-Alone Transmission segments. The company owns and operates coal-fired, nuclear, hydroelectric, wind, and solar power generating facilities. The company operates 252,959 distribution line miles and 24,157 transmission line miles, including overhead pole line and underground conduit carrying primary, secondary, and street lighting circuits. The company serves customers in Ohio, Pennsylvania, New Jersey, West Virginia, Maryland, and New York. FirstEnergy Corp. was incorporated in 1996 and is headquartered in Akron, Ohio.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"FirstEnergy Corp.는 자회사와 함께 미국에서 전력의 생성, 배전 및 송전을 담당합니다. 배전, 통합 및 독립형 전송 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 석탄 화력, 원자력, 수력, 풍력, 태양광 발전 시설을 소유하고 운영합니다. 이 회사는 1차, 2차 및 가로등 회로를 운반하는 가공 전신주 선과 지하 도관을 포함하여 252,959 배전선 마일과 24,157 송전선 마일을 운영하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 오하이오, 펜실베이니아, 뉴저지, 웨스트버지니아, 메릴랜드 및 뉴욕의 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. FirstEnergy Corp.는 1996년에 설립되었으며 오하이오주 애크런에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":46.62,"mcap":26988005376.0,"pe":22.52174,"fpe":15.8256,"peg":1.9383,"ps":1.6820197,"pb":2.0800428,"ev_ebitda":11.379,"div":4.01,"beta":0.374,"hi52":52.34,"lo52":42.67},"fin":{"rev":16044999680.0,"rev_g":0.099,"eps_g":0.263,"gross":0.69628996,"op":0.21242,"net":0.07485,"roe":0.10041001,"fcf":-2547124992.0,"cash":48000000.0,"debt":30051999744.0,"de":207.269,"eps":2.07,"feps":2.94586},"own":{"short":0.0723,"inst":0.95579004,"insider":0.0013799999},"analyst":{"n":14,"mean":50.64286,"median":50.0,"high":56.0,"low":46.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.05556,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":8,"sell":0,"stro